re</a></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"m_3609661784031651280row-content m_3609661784031651280stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#fafafa;border-bottom:1px solid #0aa43e;border-left:1px solid #0aa43e;border-radius:0;border-right:1px solid #0aa43e;border-top:1px solid #0aa43e;color:#000;width:600px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"600\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"m_3609661784031651280column\" width=\"100%\" style=\"font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:10px;padding-top:10px\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:100%;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px\" align=\"center\"><h1 style=\"margin:0;color:#000;direction:ltr;font-family:Yellix,sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\">Afternoon Must-Reads</span></h1></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"m_3609661784031651280image_block\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:100%\" align=\"center\"><div class=\"m_3609661784031651280fullWidth\" style=\"max-width:598px\"><a href=\"https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L2VpbnJpZGUtc3RyaWtlcy1kZWFsLXRvLWFkZC01MDAtdGVzbGEtc2VtaXMtdG8taXRzLWZsZWV0P3V0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1kYWlseV9wbQ/6871770a273e032f335072f3Bc34cdb09\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/