  "text_body": "----------------------------------------------\n604.339.8460\nLinkedIn <http://ca.linkedin.com/in/aisteulozaite>\n\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: TechCrunch Daily News <newsletters@techcrunch.com>\nDate: Tue, Aug 18, 2026 at 3:00 PM\nSubject: Etched's valuation doubles to $21B in a month\nTo: <aiste.ulozaite@gmail.com>\n\n\nPlus more of TechCrunch's top stories this afternoon\n\nView this email online in your browser\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/view/6871770a273e032f335072f3s1jmr.f51/dd3bf10a>\n\n\n*August 18, 2026*\n\nTechCrunch Top 3\n\n[image: Etched's valuation doubles to $21B in a month]\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L2V0Y2hlZHMtdmFsdWF0aW9uLWRvdWJsZXMtdG8tMjFiLWluLWEtbW9udGg_dXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPWRhaWx5X3Bt/6871770a273e032f335072f3B7d621853>\n\n*Etched's valuation doubles to $21B in a month*: Jane Street has installed\nEtched's first shipped AI cluster system, and was so impressed, it led\nanother massive round, the startup says. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L2V0Y2hlZHMtdmFsdWF0aW9uLWRvdWJsZXMtdG8tMjFiLWluLWEtbW9udGg_dXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPWRhaWx5X3Bt/6871770a273e032f335072f3C7d621853>\n\n*Comcast adds motion sensing to millions of its newer routers, with a\nprivacy catch*: A new feature added to Comcast's newest routers can detect\nif there is motion inside your home without needing traditional motion\nsensors. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L2NvbWNhc3QtYWRkcy1tb3Rpb24tc2Vuc2luZy10by1taWxsaW9ucy1vZi1pdHMtbmV3ZXItcm91dGVycy13aXRoLWEtcHJpdmFjeS1jYXRjaD91dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249ZGFpbHlfcG0/6871770a273e032f335072f3B15d48c47>\n\n*Why Apple's camera-equipped AirPods may not be the 'pervert pods'\nconsumers fear*: Apple’s leaked camera-equipped AirPods might avoid the\nprivacy pitfalls of other AI wearables by preventing users from recording\nphotos and videos. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L3doeS1hcHBsZXMtY2FtZXJhLWVxdWlwcGVkLWFpcnBvZHMtbWF5LW5vdC1iZS10aGUtcGVydmVydC1wb2RzLWNvbnN1bWVycy1mZWFyP3V0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1kYWlseV9wbQ/6871770a273e032f335072f3B25ad6745>\nAfternoon Must-Reads\n\n[image: Einride strikes deal to add 500 Tesla Semis to its fleet]\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L2VpbnJpZGUtc3RyaWtlcy1kZWFsLXRvLWFkZC01MDAtdGVzbGEtc2VtaXMtdG8taXRzLWZsZWV0P3V0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1kYWlseV9wbQ/6871770a273e032f335072f3Bc34cdb09>\n\n*Einride strikes deal to add 500 Tesla Semis to its fleet*: The deal will\ntriple the size of Einride's fleet while sweetening the company's sales\npitch for its Saga AI software. The Tesla Semis will be available to\ncustomers across North America. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L2VpbnJpZGUtc3RyaWtlcy1kZWFsLXRvLWFkZC01MDAtdGVzbGEtc2VtaXMtdG8taXRzLWZsZWV0P3V0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1kYWlseV9wbQ/6871770a273e032f335072f3Cc34cdb09>\n\n*OpenAI institutes new safeguards after Hugging Face breach*: The new\nsafeguards include more detailed monitoring of models during the\ndevelopment process, as well as greater emphasis on alignment and security\nduring the post-training process. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L29wZW5haS1pbnN0aXR1dGVzLW5ldy1zYWZlZ3VhcmRzLWFmdGVyLWh1Z2dpbmctZmFjZS1icmVhY2g_dXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPWRhaWx5X3Bt/6871770a273e032f335072f3Bad1b838d>\n\n*Apple's new macOS update reportedly contains a video of AirPods with a\ncamera*: A video in a macOS Tahoe release candidate version shows a user\nwearing AirPods, looking at a book, and talking to Siri. Read More\n<https://link.techcrunch.com/click/47101347.19621/aHR0cHM6Ly90ZWNoY3J1bmNoLmNvbS8yMDI2LzA4LzE4L2FwcGxlcy1uZXctbWFjb3MtdXBkYXRlLXJlcG9ydGVkbHktY29udGFpbnMtYS